  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY拼插帐篷科教积木套装",
    "en": "DIY Educational Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童科教拼搭场景的DIY帐篷积木套装，采用PP杆件与连接结构，可搭建多种空间造型，适用于家庭互动和课堂活动。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，并包含实用新型专利/著作权申请信息，支持渠道资料归档与长期供货。",
    "en": "This is a DIY educational fort building set for children’s construction-learning scenarios. It uses PP rods and connectors to build multiple spatial structures for family interaction and classroom activities.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. Utility-model patent/copyright filing information is included for channel documentation and long-term supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY拼插帐篷科教积木套装以杆件与连接球结构为核心，支持孩子搭建帐篷、房屋与堡垒等多种形态，适合创意拼装和团队协作活动。",
      "产品主材为PP，支持反复拆装。通过拼搭过程可用于空间认知、动手训练与亲子互动。品牌为尧顺，适用于家庭零售和教育活动场景。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，包含专利及著作权信息（实用新型，申请时间2010-1-1），便于跨境和渠道客户进行合规资料留存。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY educational fort set is based on a rod-and-connector system and lets children build tents, houses, and fort-like structures for creative construction and team-play activities.",
      "The product uses PP material and supports repeated assembly. The building process helps with spatial awareness, hands-on practice, and parent-child interaction. Brand: Yaoshun.",
      "Packed in a color box, the item includes patent/copyright data (utility model, filing date 2010-1-1), which is useful for cross-border and channel compliance documentation."
    ]
  },
